    "signature": "fn generate_signature_error_msg(func_name: &str, func_signature: datafusion_expr_common::signature::Signature, input_expr_types: &[arrow::datatypes::DataType]) -> String",
    "docs": "Creates a detailed error message for a function with wrong signature.\n\nFor example, a query like `select round(3.14, 1.1);` would yield:\n```text\nError during planning: No function matches 'round(Float64, Float64)'. You might need to add explicit type casts.\n    Candidate functions:\n    round(Float64, Int64)\n    round(Float32, Int64)\n    round(Float64)\n    round(Float32)\n```",
